WEBVTT

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.040
<b>The blue sky has broken through</b>

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.040
<b>Come, let's go out</b>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.880
<b>Riding my bike through the usual avenue</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.550
<b>"I want to meet you now."</b>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:37.100
<b>That thought is blown away by the wind,</b>

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>and becomes a letter being carried to you</b>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:52.360
<b>The story that starts from here... Fly!</b>

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:59.660
<b>Even if the changing seasons walk on with loud footsteps,</b>

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:06.500
<b>the wings of love won't change</b>

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>Fly far away, high into the sky</b>

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:20.720
<b>May the weather forecast of love be sunny and clear forever</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.400
<b>Tomorrow and the day after tomorrow</b>

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.940
It's this time of the year already—

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.990
The third year students almost have their exams.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:40.780
Around this time next year, it'll be the same for us.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.160
It's going by so fast—

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:47.670
So, who's running?

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:51.130
Nishimura-kun from class 1, huh?

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.670
Is he the only one?

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.090
Seems like it.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.400
Well, he'll do fine.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:59.340
Seems this guy's been doing 
secretarial jobs up till now.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:04.100
I'm not sure what a student council even does—

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.400
True.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:07.980
Next week we'll have to vote—

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:12.230
If no one else is running, it's settled already.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:14.980
Matsuri-chan?

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.660
What's this?

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.620
Oh, you were here?

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.200
Don't say that—

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.410
Good timing.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:29.620
I've decided to make you the 
new student council president.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:30.680
Good luck.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.210
She already decided.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.970
I wasn't told. I don't feel like it. I don't want to!

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:42.350
Yurie, I know all about your talents.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:49.390
Your divine powers, your mysterious 
charm, your prodigy-like charisma!

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.270
No matter how you take it, 
you're not your average student!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.150
Yeah, she's a god after all.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:03:00.860
I believe that not using that talent 
for the love of our school is a sin.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.660
You might even get cursed for it.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:07.830
But I've never taken charge of 
anything other than animals—

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:09.440
Don't worry.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:12.130
We will give you our utmost support.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.170
Of course, I'm getting dragged into this as well.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.050
It's still impossible!

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:21.550
I don't even know what a student council does!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.850
The student council has full authority over the school clubs.

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:27.850
You'll be able to give Ken-chan's 
calligraphy club its own clubroom.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:34.770
If he can freely write with a roof above 
his head, I'm sure he'll be really happy!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.320
You think so?

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.400
I'm sure of it.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.800
He'll be so grateful to the kind president—

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.780
You'll have a clear path into his heart!

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.780
Maybe I should give it a shot.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.540
That's my Yurie!

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:49.750
Let's build up a strategy right away!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:50.830
Yeah!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.750
<i>Thinking about it now, this was the beginning of 
what would go down in the history of our school—</i>

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.090
<i>as the election campaign between a man and a god.</i>

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.180
What did you say!?

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:08.960
I assumed it was decided since you were 
the only one, but just now that uh—

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:11.230
god girl from second year—

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:14.150
Hitotsubashi Yurie-san from class 2-2.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:15.100
That's the one.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:19.190
Her candidacy for the election was 
announced by uh— that flashy girl—

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.490
Saegusa Matsuri-san.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:23.530
Yeah, that's the one.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.860
Why didn't you reject it?

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:30.620
I've been doing work for the student council for a year!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.960
I am the only person worthy of 
becoming student council president!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.580
Well sure, but she's a god—

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.460
That doesn't matter at all!

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:44.190
"Every student enrolled in this school has an 
equal right to run for council presidency,"

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:45.430
as stated in the school regulations.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.640
We have to abide by the rules.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.520
Well, that's how it is.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.390
Good luck on your election campaign.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.690
Excuse me.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.530
Who cares she's a god—

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:02.110
She's completely unexperienced as a council member!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.360
We're having a strategy meeting at my place today!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.490
Hey, can we go buy some snacks on the way?

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.080
Eating on the streets goes against 
school regulations though—

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.870
We can eat them at my place, can't we?

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:16.840
That's true.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:19.040
Then how about we drop by the supermarket?

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.420
It's 4 o'clock, so the time-bargain is—

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.630
Who's that?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.250
Great timing.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.560
That's your rival, Nishimura Ukaru.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.560
But they don't look alike at all.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.650
He seems to be pretty determined.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.150
Yurie, go out and greet him!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:46.900
Hello.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.370
Hitotsubashi Yurie-kun!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:53.830
I don't care if you're a god, I won't 
hand this school over to you!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.330
Will the saviour of this school be you, a god, 
or me, a secretary of the student council!?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.290
It'll be a fair battle!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:02.840
Goodbye!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.130
Yurie!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.370
How interesting.

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:09.590
We will accept your challenge!

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.100
You wicked—

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.020
Excuse me, I'm from the newspaper club.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:26.440
This is going to be impossible for me—

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:31.030
I got embarrassed and turned bright red just now—

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:35.490
On Saturday, you'll have to give a 
lecture to all the students in our school.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:38.710
You'll have to talk all by yourself in front of everyone.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.710
I'll never be able to do that.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.840
I'll just turn red.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.340
Don't be so insecure.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.420
Let's start working before giving up.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:52.640
We'll get up early tomorrow and 
start our campaign at the front gate.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.510
Get up early?

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.640
For the sake of Ken-chan's club room.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.100
And that's not all.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.850
When Nishimura Ukaru becomes president,

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:06.400
he plans to scrap all clubs that haven't 
had much activity or achievements.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:11.960
Ken-chan's calligraphy club and our Raifuku 
Shrine Ishihama Middle School Subdivision

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:14.450
will be crushed by his evil hands!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.240
Subdivision?

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.200
The details are in here.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:25.380
Furthermore, he wants to prohibit dating and 
stricten clothing regulations, among other things.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.170
This isn't a school, it's a prison!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:33.930
The only one who can save everyone 
from this crisis is you, Yurie.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.600
I'm glad we see eye to eye.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.020
Let's start making some leaflets ourselves.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:45.730
What kind?

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.230
I have a good idea.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.110
To start with, write this down—

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.990
<i>The situation gradually escalated.</i>

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:58.040
<i>It was happening behind the scenes as well.</i>

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.000
On second thought, this 
outfit is kinda embarrassing—

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.340
Your divinity is your main appeal.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.970
We have to milk that as much as we can!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.840
Isn't this the more embarrassing one?

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.810
It seems incredibly dubious.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.270
Good morning!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.100
Good morning!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:30.400
This is Hitotsubashi Yurie from class 2-2, who 
is running for student council presidency!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.650
This time it's student council president.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.110
That's pretty amazing.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.200
Sis—

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:36.990
Saegusa.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.490
Hitotsubashi-kun?

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:42.790
I feel your pain, us both having such weird sisters.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.040
Please vote for me!

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.840
Please vote for Hitotsubashi Yurie!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.050
Here you go!

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:51.420
What's this?

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:56.180
If you support Yurie-sama, good things will happen!

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.140
I caught you red-handed!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.350
Hey, reporters from the newspaper club?

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:03.850
Did you catch that shocking moment on film?

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.140
Yes, perfectly.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:07.810
Hitotsubashi-kun.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:12.440
To think you, a god, would offer 
bribes on your election campaign.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.780
A deed unthinkable of a god.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.240
What are you talking about?

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.410
Don't play dumb!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:22.950
She just handed over an envelope with 
bribe money together with that leaflet!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.410
Bribe money?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.210
On the presidential election?

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.460
Looks like we have a front page.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.910
You have no right for candidacy.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.170
Be a good sport and withdraw.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.630
Withdraw?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.880
What is he talking about?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:37.660
Wait!

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:41.560
Just when and how was it decided that 
this envelope contained bribe money?

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.870
Are you saying it doesn't?

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:47.270
Didn't you just whisper that 
"good things would happen" to him?

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.900
Great luck.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:56.200
See? What I handed over was merely a fortune strip.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:10:00.030
A good luck mascot that 
Yurie-sama poured her heart into!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:01.660
Shit!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.660
I'm sorry!

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.790
I won.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.120
What kind of battle is she waging?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.750
Who knows?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.510
Things are heating up.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:22.180
I wonder if good things would happen if 
a god became student council president.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:25.350
Well, as long as that person has what it 
takes to be a mediator for the students,

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:28.770
it won't matter what kind of person it'll be.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.110
Be sure to eat up!

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:36.110
Remember Yurie, you have your Free-of-charge 
Problem Consultation after class.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:39.570
I don't have any time left to study!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.580
Would you do it if you had?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.360
Sorry!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:53.630
Could you pick that up?

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.430
Thanks.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.100
It got carried away by the wind.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.850
Do you want a clubroom?

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.310
Wouldn't it be nice to have a roof above your head?

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:14.270
Well, it'd be nice on rainy days.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:18.240
A certain someone might be able 
to give it to you as a present soon.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.530
Matsuri-chan!

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.160
Who?

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.620
Santa Claus?

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.700
Someone slightly closer to you.

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:39.050
Sign: Yurie-sama's Problem Consultation Room - Free of charge

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.590
Sorry to have you help me.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:40.970
It's alright.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:46.260
Will my sister be holding your campaign speech?

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.640
Nope, Mitsue-chan will.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:53.400
But since Matsuri-chan is going to write 
it, they're currently having a meeting.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.270
I see.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.190
You can start sending in people now.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:00.400
Sure.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.880
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:07.990
Welcome to Yurie-sama's Free-of-charge 
Problem Consultation Room.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:14.420
I have truly seen Yurie-sama's brilliance 
and sublimity with my own two eyes!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:19.880
It was at that moment that I realised, "This 
person is perfect to be student council president"!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:20.970
Something like that?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.880
Aren't we overdoing it?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:28.850
This doesn't seem to be about Yurie at all.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.040
It's fine to exaggerate a bit.

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.890
Being a god is her main selling point.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:36.060
There's nothing wrong with taking advantage of that.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:40.030
I think it's better to take a more natural standpoint—

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:46.570
If you get people's hopes up too much, Yurie will 
be crushed under pressure after she's elected.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.080
It'll be fine as long as we're there to help her out.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.960
Time to continue.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:58.500
If Yurie-sama gets elected, the school will 
overflow with happiness and singing voices,

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.920
the flowers will begin to bloom in profusion,

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.760
the animals in the woods will be happily dancing about!?

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.970
Nishimura-kun—

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.140
Why are you here?

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.140
What do you think I'm here for?

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.240
I came to talk about my problems.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:15.710
I'm sorry.

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:17.860
He forced himself past me—

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:18.720
What?

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:21.730
Are you being discriminate about who to give consult?

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:23.860
You won't listen to my problems?

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.460
It's okay, Miko-chan.

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:28.490
I'll listen to him.

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:29.950
Excuse me.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:35.500
So, what's bothering you?

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.750
I want to become president no matter what.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.260
I want to make this school a better place!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:47.590
I want to make this a beautiful middle school that both 
enrolled and graduated students would be proud of,

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:52.060
an excellent school to set an 
example for the entire prefecture!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:57.520
To do that, I need to change what needs to be 
changed, starting with this school's entire image!

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:02.440
But to think now that I've come this 
far, someone would step in my way—

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:05.070
No, a god appeared.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.610
Yes, I mean you.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.280
I want to become student council president.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.040
Even if it means having to pray to a god.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.660
Hitotsubashi-san, what should I do?

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.040
You shouldn't be asking that of me—

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:23.340
You're a god, but you can't even help me with my problem?

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.760
Because—

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:30.320
Basically, you're trying to manipulate me—

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.180
That's unfair!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.370
It's not!

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:36.350
It's a given that a god should help those in need!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.350
A god that can't even help a single person

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:42.610
could never save this entire school!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:47.990
Matsuri-chan!

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:56.040
You hit me! Exerting violence is a
 grave violation of school regulations!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.340
It's not violence!

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:58.500
It's divine punishment!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.500
Trying to manipulate your enemy into resigning 
from the battle before the fight is the easy way out!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.500
You coward!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.720
Isn't that the same as visiting a shrine to worship?

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:08.220
I just came here to make a wish to god.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:12.590
Then, as a shrine maiden, let me tell you this.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:16.970
Wishes without effort and offerings will never be granted!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:25.110
And that's the end of that—

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:28.320
If you get it now, reflect upon 
your actions and better your ways.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.820
Shit—

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.200
I'm sorry!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.830
I won again.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:42.080
Wouldn't it have been better if 
you had run for election instead?

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:43.520
No way.

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.630
I don't have any charisma.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.300
That's not true.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.920
You looked really cool just now.

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:56.100
Really?

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:06.770
Mitsue-chan—

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:15.450
Is it really such a given that a 
god should help those in need?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:26.040
I wonder if that's a god's obligation—

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:35.220
If all wishes would be granted, people 
would be happy and free of troubles—

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:41.810
But if that happened, people wouldn't 
have to do anything anymore.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:47.480
I'm sure we can handle the amount of 
troubles we currently have on our own.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.400
I guess so.

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:53.950
Thanks.

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:03.620
<i>The week passed in the blink of an eye,</i>

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.250
and the election day arrived.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:12.010
—and, to give you the best school life in the country,

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:15.180
it is necessary to set up strict 
rules for everyone to follow.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:19.050
Upholding the regulations, giving 
severe penalties to violators,

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:24.730
it is my goal to create a wholesome 
atmosphere void of bullying and violence!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:32.360
<i>This was election candidate Nishimura Ukaru-kun.</i>

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:40.240
<i>Next up is class 2-2's Hitotsubashi Yurie-san's campaign speech, held by Shijou Mitsue-san.</i>

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.030
Well, I'm up.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.050
I am Shijou Mitsue.

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:04.060
I am recommending my classmate Hitotsubashi 
Yurie-san for student council presidency.

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:13.320
Mitsue-chan?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:22.870
I'm sure you all know, but Yurie is a god.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:28.080
But she's a little different from 
how we imagine a god to be.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:29.760
She's clumsy—

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.290
She forgot her homework the other day!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.750
Mitsue-chan!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:37.470
If you spend time with her, you'll see 
she's just a normal middle school student.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:41.300
In fact, she might be kinda unreliable.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:47.600
So, if you ask me whether or not she could 
make this school better with her powers,

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.690
I think that might be impossible.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:55.690
But, as I'm sure the people who have come 
for consult during lunch or after class know,

00:18:55.690 --> 00:19:00.160
she's a person who is genuinely 
concerned about the troubles of others.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:06.120
That's not because she's a god, 
 because that's her true nature.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.920
She's the type to do her utmost best for others' sake.

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:14.730
So in case she becomes president,

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:19.130
I'm sure she'll think and worry for all she's worth.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:25.100
I'll bet it'll come to the point where 
we will have to help her out ourselves.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:33.060
If you think, even for a little bit, that it'd be 
okay to share some hardships with Yurie,

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:35.980
please vote for her.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:39.990
I know I will!

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:10.770
Mitsue-chan!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.520
Sorry for saying those things about you.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:24.610
<i>Continuing, election candidate Hitotsubashi Yurie-san will have a word.</i>

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.370
Good luck.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:47.020
I'm Hitotsubashi— Yurie—

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.390
Student council president
Hitotsubashi Yurie

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.520
It was a short dream—

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:04.110
Looks like Ninomiya-kun has to put 
up with it a little while longer—

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.070
He seems to like it up there.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:09.030
The view is great too.

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:12.830
It fits him better than some 
small clubroom, don't you think?

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.170
It doesn't really matter anymore.

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:21.840
It's been decided that all clubs and 
associations will remain as they were.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.010
"As they were" is not good!

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:29.220
I wanted to settle our Raifuku Shrine 
Subdivision in the student council room—

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.060
So that's what you were scheming—

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:33.730
How cruel.

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.190
Yurie's the one being cruel.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:48.570
She made it like this in just a single day—

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.540
She overdid it a little—

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.500
She was overjoyed to be chosen by everyone,

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:58.040
but she went up in the moment a little too much.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:03.800
What's the point if you just fall 
asleep after overusing your powers?

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:05.920
Hey!

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:09.930
Ah, it's the new president.

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:11.770
It's been a whole week!

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:14.020
Hitotsubashi-kun still hasn't woken up?

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:17.140
She still seemed to be sound asleep today.

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:21.310
It's because she's altered the 
entire school to this extent—

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:24.820
Anyway, she'll wake up eventually.

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:27.530
Hurry up and wake her and make 
her return the school back to normal.

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:29.740
I'm swamped with work every day.

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:32.910
You became president through a revote.

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:34.200
What did you expect?

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:39.040
I'll have you take responsibility for this later.

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:45.880
It's out of the question he'll hand 
over his position at this point.

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:49.970
Well, let's go as well.

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:54.350
Can we really scrape out a 
pool's worth of pudding with this?

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:57.260
Unfortunately, there's no other way.

00:22:57.260 --> 00:22:59.690
I don't know how many days this will take though.

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.480
Wake up already, Yurie!

00:23:05.400 --> 00:23:11.570
<i>And so, the legend of sorts of Yurie's time as student 
council president of Ishihama Middle School—</i>

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:13.950
<i>was talked about for generations to come.</i>

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:19.310
I'm Yurie!

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:21.420
I'll do my best!

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:32.060
<b>The last class of the day never seems to end</b>

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:36.970
<b>Even if I keep glancing at my watch, a second seems an eternity</b>

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:44.040
<b>In the radiant schoolyard, trailing your running visage,</b>

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:49.180
<b>my imagination is running wild about our date after class</b>

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:53.090
<b>The school chimes ring and it's a signal of love!</b>

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:56.090
<b>Be careful if you rush out into the hallway!</b>

00:23:56.090 --> 00:23:59.060
<b>I dash to see you, first thing!</b>

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:01.640
<b>Let's go home together!</b>

00:24:02.650 --> 00:24:09.320
<b>Sharing a soda-flavored popsicle under the glaring sun</b>

00:24:09.320 --> 00:24:15.320
<b>My youth seems to melt with it, it makes my heart beat faster</b>

00:24:15.320 --> 00:24:20.830
<b>I'm shutting our casual time in my heart</b>

00:24:21.110 --> 00:24:28.200
<b>Tomorrow I will love you even more than today</b>

00:24:32.390 --> 00:24:34.380
I have urgent news!

00:24:34.380 --> 00:24:40.760
It seems first year students Hitotsubashi 
Shoukichi-kun and Saegusa Miko-chan have eloped!

00:24:40.760 --> 00:24:42.010
What a shocker!

00:24:42.010 --> 00:24:44.220
Their "Love is Missing".

00:24:44.220 --> 00:24:46.680
This was Yurie's chuchuu news!
